* ============================================================================
* 21_collab_iv_2sls.do — P5 paper-specific IV (2026-06-13 IV 补全)
* Paper: bank_fintech_collab (Chesbrough 自主研发 vs 外部协同)
*
* 内生变量: collab_frac (外部协同文章占比, paper_spec treatment.primary)
* IV (paper_spec identification.iv, iv_extensions.py 物化):
*   primary  = leave_one_out_peer_collab_iv (同银行类型×年 LOO 协同占比;
*              滞后稳健性变体 leave_one_out_peer_collab_iv_lag1)
*   fallback = bartik_collab_iv_full        (基期类型共现份额 × 同类 LOO
*              协同占比, GPSS 2020 AER share 外生性视角)
* 白话: "自己研发还是找外部伙伴"由银行能力内生决定; 借同类型同业的协同
* 潮流与基期题材结构 × 行业行情当外生推力, 缓解互为因果。
*
* 第二阶段 DV: m_and_a_fintech (并购事件数据待接入; 缺列时 2SLS 优雅跳过,
* 第一阶段照常输出)。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

local TX   collab_frac
local IV1  leave_one_out_peer_collab_iv
local IV1L leave_one_out_peer_collab_iv_lag1
local IV2  bartik_collab_iv_full
local DV   m_and_a_fintech
* ctx 轨镜像 (2026-06-13 终审): 内生孪生 collab_frac_cm 配 ctx 同业 LOO 工具
* lpeer_collab_iv_ctx, 与 full 轨【各自 just-identified、并排成列】表达双轨互为
* 稳健性; 勿与 full 轨 LOO 合成 overid — 同文两窗共同冲击同污染, Hansen J
* 零功效 (Parente & Santos Silva 2012 EL)。
local TXC  collab_frac_cm
local IVC  lpeer_collab_iv_ctx
* ss 轨镜像 (2026-06-14 第三轨 _ss 平价补全): 内生孪生 collab_frac_cm_ss 配 ss 同业
* LOO 工具 lpeer_collab_iv_ss, 与 full / ctx 轨【各自 just-identified、并排成列】表达
* 三轨互为稳健性; 严禁 full/ctx/ss 任两轨 LOO 合成 overid — 同文三窗共同冲击同污染,
* Hansen J 零功效 (Parente & Santos Silva 2012 EL)。
* ⚠ 命名: ss 轨内生孪生列名 = collab_frac_cm_ss (在 ctx 孪生 collab_frac_cm 后再缀 _ss,
*   iv_extensions.py 对角创新命名), 勿误拼 collab_frac_ss 否则静默全 NaN。
local TXS  collab_frac_cm_ss
local IVS  lpeer_collab_iv_ss

* ⚠ FE 锁定 = bank FE + year FE; 严禁 bank_type×year 交互 FE — 同业 LOO 工具
*   格内残余 = 自身内生变量的负镜像, type×year FE 下工具退化、排他性按构造违反。
capture confirm variable `TX'
if _rc {
    display "  [WARN] 内生变量 `TX' 不在面板; 表跳过"
    exit 0
}
capture which ivreg2
if _rc {
    display "  [WARN] ivreg2 not installed (ssc install ivreg2); 表跳过"
    exit 0
}

* 第一阶段 (现有面板即可运行): 同期 + 滞后变体 (IV-1 修复 2026-06-14:
*   addnote 早承诺 lag-1 稳健列但表里缺 eststo, 现补 first_lag/tsls_lag 兑现,
*   镜像 locus/20 已落地写法; Manski 1993 反射对象用滞后同业 LOO 缓解。)
capture confirm variable `IV1'
if !_rc {
    eststo first_loo: reghdfe `TX' `IV1' $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
capture confirm variable `IV1L'
if !_rc {
    eststo first_lag: reghdfe `TX' `IV1L' $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
capture confirm variable `IV2'
if !_rc {
    eststo first_bartik: reghdfe `TX' `IV2' $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
* ctx 轨一阶段 (collab_frac_cm ~ ctx LOO 工具; 缺列优雅跳过)
capture confirm variable `TXC' `IVC'
if !_rc {
    eststo first_ctx: reghdfe `TXC' `IVC' $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
* ss 轨一阶段 (collab_frac_cm_ss ~ ss LOO 工具; 缺列优雅跳过)
capture confirm variable `TXS' `IVS'
if !_rc {
    eststo first_ss: reghdfe `TXS' `IVS' $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}

* 2SLS (DV 待外部并购数据; 缺列优雅跳过)
capture confirm variable `DV'
if _rc {
    display "  [WARN] 第二阶段 DV `DV' 未物化 (并购事件数据未接入); 仅输出第一阶段"
}
else {
    capture confirm variable `IV1'
    if !_rc {
        eststo tsls_loo: ivreg2 `DV' (`TX' = `IV1') $controls ///
            i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) first
    }
    * lag-1 稳健 2SLS 列 (IV-1 兑现 addnote 承诺; 与 first_lag 配对)
    capture confirm variable `IV1L'
    if !_rc {
        eststo tsls_lag: ivreg2 `DV' (`TX' = `IV1L') $controls ///
            i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) first
    }
    capture confirm variable `IV1' `IV2'
    if !_rc {
        * 过度识别列 (跨族 2 工具 1 内生 → Hansen J df=1; LOO×Bartik 识别假设
        * 异质, 合法 overid — 区别于被否决的 full×ctx 同文双窗)
        eststo tsls_overid: ivreg2 `DV' (`TX' = `IV1' `IV2') $controls ///
            i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) first
    }
    * ctx 轨 just-identified 2SLS (与 full 轨 tsls_loo 并排; 同一 DV, 双轨各自工具)
    capture confirm variable `TXC' `IVC'
    if !_rc {
        eststo tsls_ctx: ivreg2 `DV' (`TXC' = `IVC') $controls ///
            i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) first
    }
    * ss 轨 just-identified 2SLS (与 full 轨 tsls_loo / ctx 轨 tsls_ctx 并排;
    * 同一 DV, 三轨各自工具; 三轨各自 just-id 绝不合并 Hansen J)
    capture confirm variable `TXS' `IVS'
    if !_rc {
        eststo tsls_ss: ivreg2 `DV' (`TXS' = `IVS') $controls ///
            i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) first
    }

    * ── IV-2 修复 (2026-06-14): 弱工具稳健 Anderson-Rubin CI ─────────────────
    * 脚注早已规定 "KP F < Stock-Yogo 时改读 AR CI", 但全项目无 weakiv 命令
    * 兑现该决策规则 (claimed-but-never-run)。现对主 just-identified 列 (LOO 同期 /
    * lag-1 / Bartik / ctx) 跑 `weakiv` 输出 AR 检验 + 弱工具稳健置信集, 写入侧表 .txt;
    * 缺 ado / T=2 退化时优雅跳过 (capture which 守卫, $0/golden-safe)。
    * 锚点: Andrews-Stock-Sun 2019 ARE; Lee et al. 2022 AER (tF); Stock-Yogo 2005。
    *
    * ⚠ IV-2 复核修复 (2026-06-14, PROJECT_REAUDIT collab smoke lane): 两处真错已修。
    *   (a) weakiv 选项错: 旧 `weakiv ivreg2 ..., cluster(bank_id) lm ar` 中 `ar` 不是
    *       weakiv 合法选项 (实测 StataNow 19.5 报 "option ar not allowed" → _rc!=0 →
    *       四个 AR CI 块全静默跳过, 侧表只剩表头 = claimed-but-not-run)。weakiv 默认即
    *       计算 AR 检验, 无需 `ar`; `lm` 合法 (请求 LM 版本) 故保留。删 `ar` 后四次
    *       weakiv 在 T=18 合成盘均 _rc==0 (实测 AR p 真写出)。
    *   (b) 返回值类: weakiv 结果在 e() 不在 r() (ado:1309 ereturn scalar ar_p;
    *       :1361 ereturn local ar_cset【字符串置信集】, 无 e(ar_cset_lb/ub))。旧读
    *       r(ar_p)/e(ar_cset_lb/ub) 全取到 missing/空 → 改读 e(ar_p) + 字符串 e(ar_cset)。
    *   置信集以【字符串】宏在引号内当文本写文件 (不用数值括号 expr, 不再拆 lb/ub);
    *   每次 weakiv 后 capture local 取标量再写, 整块外加 capture 守卫, weakiv 在场亦
    *   绝不硬中断后面 esttab IV 主表。
    capture which weakiv
    if _rc {
        display "  [WARN] weakiv not installed (ssc install weakiv); 跳过弱工具稳健 AR CI"
    }
    else {
        capture {
            capture file close _arci
            file open _arci using "$tables_dir/tableA_collab_iv_arci.txt", write replace
            file write _arci "P5 Collab weak-IV-robust Anderson-Rubin CIs (Andrews-Stock-Sun 2019)" _n
            file write _arci "Read these AR CIs whenever KP F < Stock-Yogo 10% maximal-IV-size critical value (1 instrument) = 16.38." _n _n
            * 同期 LOO
            capture confirm variable `IV1'
            if !_rc {
                capture noisily weakiv ivreg2 `DV' (`TX' = `IV1') $controls ///
                    i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) lm
                if !_rc {
                    local _arp = .
                    local _arset = ""
                    capture local _arp   = e(ar_p)
                    capture local _arset = "`e(ar_cset)'"
                    file write _arci "[LOO contemporaneous] AR p = `_arp'  AR 95% confidence set = `_arset'" _n
                }
            }
            * lag-1 LOO
            capture confirm variable `IV1L'
            if !_rc {
                capture noisily weakiv ivreg2 `DV' (`TX' = `IV1L') $controls ///
                    i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) lm
                if !_rc {
                    local _arp = .
                    local _arset = ""
                    capture local _arp   = e(ar_p)
                    capture local _arset = "`e(ar_cset)'"
                    file write _arci "[LOO lag-1] AR p = `_arp'  AR 95% confidence set = `_arset'" _n
                }
            }
            * Bartik
            capture confirm variable `IV2'
            if !_rc {
                capture noisily weakiv ivreg2 `DV' (`TX' = `IV2') $controls ///
                    i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) lm
                if !_rc {
                    local _arp = .
                    local _arset = ""
                    capture local _arp   = e(ar_p)
                    capture local _arset = "`e(ar_cset)'"
                    file write _arci "[Bartik] AR p = `_arp'  AR 95% confidence set = `_arset'" _n
                }
            }
            * ctx 轨
            capture confirm variable `TXC' `IVC'
            if !_rc {
                capture noisily weakiv ivreg2 `DV' (`TXC' = `IVC') $controls ///
                    i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) lm
                if !_rc {
                    local _arp = .
                    local _arset = ""
                    capture local _arp   = e(ar_p)
                    capture local _arset = "`e(ar_cset)'"
                    file write _arci "[ctx LOO] AR p = `_arp'  AR 95% confidence set = `_arset'" _n
                }
            }
            * ss 轨
            capture confirm variable `TXS' `IVS'
            if !_rc {
                capture noisily weakiv ivreg2 `DV' (`TXS' = `IVS') $controls ///
                    i.bank_id i.year, cluster(bank_id) lm
                if !_rc {
                    local _arp = .
                    local _arset = ""
                    capture local _arp   = e(ar_p)
                    capture local _arset = "`e(ar_cset)'"
                    file write _arci "[ss LOO] AR p = `_arp'  AR 95% confidence set = `_arset'" _n
                }
            }
            file close _arci
            display "[OK] weak-IV-robust AR CIs → $tables_dir/tableA_collab_iv_arci.txt"
        }
        capture file close _arci
    }
}

* esttab 名单动态化 (缺估计不点名, 防 r(111) 丢整表)
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models first_loo first_lag first_bartik first_ctx first_ss tsls_loo tsls_lag tsls_overid tsls_ctx tsls_ss
local cand_titles `""1st LOO" "1st LOO lag1" "1st Bartik" "1st LOO ctx" "1st LOO ss" "2SLS LOO" "2SLS LOO lag1" "2SLS Overid" "2SLS LOO ctx" "2SLS LOO ss""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  [WARN] IV 表无任何已存储估计 (IV 列全缺), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' ///
        using "$tables_dir/tableA_collab_iv_2sls.tex", replace ///
        star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
        stats(N r2 widstat jp, fmt(0 3 3 3) labels("N" "R²" "KP F" "Hansen J p")) ///
        title("P5 Collab IV: Peer LOO + Bartik (First Stage + 2SLS)") ///
        mtitles(`mtitles') ///
        addnotes("IV1 = same-bank-type leave-one-out external-collaboration share (Manski 1993; Leary-Roberts 2014 JF caveats — disclose in text; lag-1 variant for robustness)." ///
                 "IV2 = Bartik: base-period type co-mention shares x type-year LOO collaboration share (Goldsmith-Pinkham et al. 2020 AER, share-exogeneity view only)." ///
                 "ctx column: entity-window twin collab_frac_cm instrumented by lpeer_collab_iv_ctx, just-identified, side-by-side dual-track robustness — NOT pooled with full-track IV (same-text windows make Hansen J uninformative; Parente-Santos Silva 2012)." ///
                 "ss column: bank+fintech same-sentence twin collab_frac_cm_ss instrumented by lpeer_collab_iv_ss, just-identified, side-by-side tri-track robustness — full/ctx/ss are NEVER pooled into one Hansen J (same-article windows co-contaminate; Parente-Santos Silva 2012)." ///
                 "KP F = Kleibergen-Paap rk Wald F; Stock-Yogo 10% maximal-IV-size critical value (1 instrument) = 16.38 (Stock-Yogo 2005); maximal-relative-bias thresholds apply only to over-identified models with >=3 instruments. If KP F is below, read the weak-IV-robust Anderson-Rubin CIs reported in tableA_collab_iv_arci.txt (Andrews-Stock-Sun 2019; weakiv command). Hansen J only in overidentified column." ///
                 "Hansen J power depends on first-stage strength: when KP F is below the Stock-Yogo critical value, a non-rejecting Hansen J (p>0.05) has low power and must NOT be read as confirming instrument validity.")

    display "[OK] 21_collab_iv_2sls → $tables_dir/tableA_collab_iv_2sls.tex"
}
